OL,3,GNEWSASchool with suspended head put in
OL,4,Aspecial measures
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school has been placed into
OL,7,Fspecial measures after it was found
OL,8,Fsafeguarding standards were not met.
OL,10,FAn Ofsted inspection at Cambois Primary
OL,11,FSchool, in Northumberland, in September
OL,12,Ffound it lacked a coherent curriculum
OL,13,Fand had poor teaching, meaning pupils
OL,14,Fwere not adequately prepared for Year
OL,15,F7.
OL,17,FHead teacher Marianne Allan was
OL,18,Fsuspended from the school a year ago.
OL,19,FNorthumberland County Council said the
OL,20,Freason was confidential and Allan said
OL,21,Fshe could not comment.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
