OL,3,GNEWSASchool with suspended head put in
OL,4,Aspecial measures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said it had been working to
OL,7,Faddress "key weaknesses" at the school
OL,8,Fand a "recent change in leadership has
OL,9,Fbeen welcomed by staff and raised
OL,10,Fmorale, and this gives the school a
OL,11,Fstrong base to move forward from".
